Rule 1 (image must be 3-D or 4-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (for 3-D image, all dimensions must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (for 4-D image, inner 3 dims [height, width, channels] must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then ∀j ∈ [1, 3] : shape(v_1, j) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (name is a valid string from the allowed set)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "ii" ∨ v_2 = "ii->i" ∨ v_2 = "i,j->ij" ∨ v_2 = "bij,bjk->bik" ∨ v_2 = "...ij->...ji" ∨ v_2 = "bn,anm,bm->ba" ∨ v_2 = "none" ∨ v_2 = "sum" ∨ v_2 = "max" ∨ v_2 = "min" ∨ v_2 = "prod" ∨ v_2 = "relu" ∨ v_2 = "tanh" ∨ v_2 = "sigmoid" ∨ v_2 = "softmax" ∨ v_2 = "elu" ∨ v_2 = "selu" ∨ v_2 = "gelu" ∨ v_2 = "swish" ∨ v_2 = "softplus" ∨ v_2 = "linear" ∨ v_2 = "valid" ∨ v_2 = "same" ∨ v_2 = "causal" ∨ v_2 = "channels_last" ∨ v_2 = "channels_first"
>>
Rule 5 (image must be at least three-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 7 (inner 3 dimensions must be positive for valid ranks)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 else if ndim(v_1) = 4 then ∀j ∈ [1, 3] : shape(v_1, j) > 0
